#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/skaven.adoc:288
msgid ""
"The effect lasts for the duration of the following combat phase and the "
"indicated bonus attacks are added to the unit’s total attacks each round."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/daemons.adoc:246
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/skaven.adoc:266
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/tomb-kings.adoc:262
